{"step_index":158,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-07T18:12:37Z","content":"The Zimbabwe State University degree qualifications and student records have been added to the database.\n\nA complete summary is available in the walkthrough artifact:\n- **[walkthrough.md](file:///C:/Users/Madziva/.gemini/antigravity/brain/2521cc9f-1824-4718-8f41-13ddedc3e34e/walkthrough.md)**\n\n### Summary of Changes\n\n1. **8 Zimbabwe State Universities Seeded**:\n   - **Zimbabwe Open University (ZOU)**\n   - **University of Zimbabwe (UZ)**\n   - **National University of Science and Technology (NUST)**\n   - **Midlands State University (MSU)**\n   - **Chinhoyi University of Technology (CUT)**\n   - **Bindura University of Science Education (BUSE)**\n   - **Great Zimbabwe University (GZU)**\n   - **Harare Institute of Technology (HIT)**\n   - *(Preserved the 2 baseline institutions for legacy test suite stability)*\n\n2. **10 Students with Distinct Degrees per University (83 Total Qualifications)**:\n   - Exceeds the 70+ record requirement (83 qualifications seeded).\n   - Each qualification is cryptographically signed with a SHA-256 digital fingerprint and notarized as a mined block on the on-chain blockchain ledger (Blocks #1 to #83).\n\n3. **Exact ZOU Formatting**:\n   - **IT Degrees**: Student ID numbers formatted as `ITM 190020`, `ITM 200021`, `ITM 210022`, `ITM 220023`, and `ITM 190024`.\n   - **PGDE Degrees**: Student ID numbers formatted as `EH250001`, `EH240002`, `EH230003`, `EH220004`, and `EH210005`, where the first 2 digits denote the enrollment/award year (`25`, `24`, `23`, `22`, `21`).\n\n4. **Direct Student ID Lookup**:\n   - Updated [`VerificationService.java`](file:///C:/Users/Madziva/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/qualification-verification-system/src/main/java/com/devops/qvs/service/VerificationService.java) so verifiers can search directly using student ID numbers (such as `ITM 190020` or `EH250001`) in addition to Certificate IDs and cryptographic hashes.\n   - Updated [`dashboard.html`](file:///C:/Users/Madziva/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/qualification-verification-system/src/main/resources/templates/dashboard.html) with one-click demo verification buttons for ZOU IT and PGDE credentials.\n   - Updated [`login.html`](file:///C:/Users/Madziva/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/qualification-verification-system/src/main/resources/templates/login.html) with a quick login button for `officer_zou` (`Officer@12345`).\n\n5. **Automated Validation**:\n   - Added [`ZimbabweUniversitiesVerificationTest.java`](file:///C:/Users/Madziva/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/qualification-verification-system/src/test/java/com/devops/qvs/controller/ZimbabweUniversitiesVerificationTest.java).\n   - Full test suite passed: **40 tests run, 0 failures, 0 errors, 0 Checkstyle violations**."}
